Input: [ID:p10] Jhonatan: Mau rabu ?
       [ID:p11] Yoga: boleh, bisa jam berapa rabu?
       [ID:p12] Nur: kamis bagaimana jam berapa? Jam 10 saja
       [ID:p13] Jhonatan: Okkay jam 10
Output: [{"id": 21, "state": "resolve", "task": "Schedule SAMCO discussion this week", "assignee": "shared", "assignee_reason": "Participants converged on Thursday 10am; the scheduling task's outcome is reached.", "category": "TASK", "source_ts": "p13"}]
