Existing Tasks: [{"id": 7, "task": "Check service version on on-premise collection server", "original_text": "Adira want to know what service version currently running on their collection server"}]
Input: [ID:p9] __CURRENT_USER__: Hi Yoga, product/agent questions like these go directly to the HQ product channel: #helpdesk-intake. You have access — please use it directly for this type of question. Move both questions there with the screenshots.
Output: [{"id": 7, "state": "resolve", "task": "Check service version on on-premise collection server", "assignee": "shared", "assignee_reason": "Current user routed the inquiry to another channel (#helpdesk-intake); routing is closure of the original inquiry.", "category": "QUERY", "source_ts": "p9"}]
